# A local declared in one macro block and read through pointerof in a later block.
# The class body is one Expressions, spliced in order. The later site must be parsed
# knowing the name the earlier expansion declared. pointerof refuses the name when
# that scope is missing, and a class body is outside any def.
class SeminlLater
  {% if true %}
    seminl_earlier = 1
  {% end %}
  {% if true %}
    seminl_later_ptr = pointerof(seminl_earlier)
  {% end %}
end
